    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ieA special opportunity to purchase a discreetly, charming residence set amidst circa 2 acres of sylvan environs featuring the ancient Ladies Walk route together with mature planting of exotic arboreal specimen such as giant Bamboo, Walnut trees, together with 100 year old plus Beech, Sycamore & Ash trees, fruit trees to include apple, plum, cherry & pear. Thistle Doo offers tranquility, absolute privacy and a wonderful garden amenity ready to explore, enjoy and curate.Located within minutes of N4, Drumsna, Carrick-on-Shannon & Mohill, the area and landscape is steeped in history, flora & fauna including nearby Gortconnellan Spa Lough, Headford Lough & House ruins, inspiration for Anthony Trollopes acclaimed debut novel, The MacDermot's of Ballycoloran. Viewing by prior appointment highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - \nGranite steps and retaining wall leading to Entrance Porch. Hardwood door with fanlight and side windows, vintage floor tiling, coving & ceiling rose with brass lantern light fittings, radiator. Glazed, hardwood inner door and side light.\n\nEntrance Hall - 7.34m x 1.77m\nStained wood flooring, coving, radiator, bronze picture wall light, ceiling rose with brass lantern light fitting.\n\nSittingroom - 4.35m x 3.58m\nStained wood flooring, coving, ceiling rose with 3 lamp light fitting, picture rail, chrome picture wall light, cast iron fireplace with Art Noveau style inset tiling and slate hearth with solid fuel stove. Glazed door out to garden with \"Antique\" curtain pole, finials & drapes. Window with curtain pole, drape & Georgian style holdback.\n\nGuest WC & WHB - \nTiled floor & wall splash back, chrome towel rail, radiator, window.\n\nHome Office/Study - 2.76m x 2.57m\nDownlighters, uPVC window, fibre broadband.\n\nLarge walk in airing cupboard - \n\n\nSunroom - 4.61m x 3.29m\nStone Floor tiles, windows x 4, superb natural daylight, French doors with glazed side panels out to garden. Bronze wall lights x 2, downlighters.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 26.94 sq m\nStone floor tiles, shaker beech base and cupboard units with ceramic hob, Bosch integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge freezer, stainless steel extractor hood, EFEL oil stove which heats hot water. Picture wall light, bronze wall lamps x 2, downlighters, radiator x 2. Pleasant views of east facing rear garden and west facing drive.\n\nUtility Room - 2.96m x 1.79m\nTiled floor, fitted with shaker beech units, plumbed for washer & dryer, radiator, window & glazed door.\n\nFirst Floor - \nWindow with garden views, carpet to landing with bronze lantern & wall lamp, radiator, stira stairs with access to generous storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.96m x 3.62m\nCarpet, window x 2 with Silk & Cotton drapes and tie backs.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.97m x 2.14m\nCarpet, window x 2 with curtain pole, drapes & tie backs, radiator.\n\nEnsuite - 2.47m x 1.85m\nTiled floor & splashback, corner shower enclosure with Mira Elite shower, chrome fittings, window with wood slat blind.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.58m x 3.47m\nCarpet, window x 2 with chrome pole, drapes & tie backs, Chrystal & chrome chandelier, bronze ironmongery to doors, radiator.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.58m x 2.89m\nBuilt in sliderobe wardrobe, good natural light, pendant light fitting, window x 2 with bronze poles, drapes & retainers, radiator.\n\nBathroom - 2.59m x 1.8m\nTiled, power shower and bathtub, window, radiator, chrome fittings.\n\nGENERAL - \nOFCHFiber BroadbandGroup Water Scheme\n\nEXTERNAL - \nExtensive garden area with feature raised, stone patio and barbeque.Wonderful mature gardens with two orchard areas planted with apple, pear, cherry & plum trees. Other species include a magnificent giant bamboo tree, sycamore, beech, holly, ash, wild rose hip.Metal garden shed with open lean-to.Oil Tank & Boiler.\n\nAdditional - \n:These particulars have been prepared by Sherry FitzGerald Farrell and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of Sherry FitzGerald Farrell.\n\n"
      },
